ex:ecGmnCompactionOverclaim a gmeow:ExampleConformance ;
    gmeow:exampleFile "tests/counter-examples/gmn-compaction-overclaim.ttl" ;
    gmeow:expectedOutcome gmeow:violates ;
    gmeow:expectedViolationCode "shacl.SPARQLConstraintComponent" ;
    gmeow:conformanceRationale "The gmeow:GmnCompaction's linked correspondence claims logic:ExactPreservation with a mnemomorphic witness — stronger than the logic:ValidationOnly the compaction discipline licenses (the sh:sparql of lang:GmnCompactionOverclaimShape) — so validation MUST emit shacl.SPARQLConstraintComponent and NO other finding (lang:GmnCompactionOverclaim); the compaction is fully provenance-linked, so the provenance gate stays quiet." .

